review_text:
Boring gameplay;
One of those "i want to be cryptic and mysterious just for the sake of it" games;
They recommend you to play on the hardest difficulty, which often leads to you hardlocking yourself in a deathloop. 

And then you go read reviews or posts about the game and there will always be one of those "BU-BU-BUT ITS SUPPOSED TO BE LIKE THAT, YOU ARE SUPPOSED TO FEEL DISCOMFORT";
Sure my guy, just give me my refund.
